{"slug": "C_S02E15", "video_name": "Community - S02E15 - Early 21st Century Romanticism Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E15 - Early 21st Century Romanticism Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1271.941, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 510, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 6.549787234042554, "text": "Why does being a librarian"}, {"start": 6.549787234042554, "end": 11.84, "text": "make her even hotter?"}, {"start": 11.84, "end": 12.84, "text": "The keepers of knowledge."}, {"start": 12.84, "end": 14.990869565217391, "text": "She holds the answers to all of our questions, like"}, {"start": 14.990869565217391, "end": 16.72, "text": "will you marry me and why are there still"}, {"start": 16.72, "end": 17.72, "text": "libraries?"}, {"start": 17.72, "end": 18.72, "text": "I don't want to be a book."}, {"start": 18.72, "end": 22.64, "text": "She can pick me up, flip through my pages, make sure nobody intrude wieners in me."}, {"start": 22.64, "end": 23.64, "text": "Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 23.64, "end": 26.84, "text": "Hey, maybe for too long she'll shish us."}, {"start": 26.84, "end": 27.84, "text": "Books!"}, {"start": 27.84, "end": 32.2, "text": "Patana, get her a seat."}, {"start": 32.2, "end": 34.64421052631579, "text": "Jeff, what do you do when you and your best"}, {"start": 34.64421052631579, "end": 37.6, "text": "friend want to ask the same girls at the valentine's"}, {"start": 37.6, "end": 39.21, "text": "dance but neither of you have dibs because you"}, {"start": 39.21, "end": 40.68, "text": "both fell in love with her at first sight?"}, {"start": 40.68, "end": 44.92, "text": "Well, I don't believe in dibs, or love at first sight, or love, or best friends, or"}, {"start": 44.92, "end": 45.92, "text": "doing things."}, {"start": 45.92, "end": 47.08, "text": "But it's good you brought this to me."}, {"start": 47.08, "end": 48.08, "text": "You're gonna have to open your heart one day, Jeff."}, {"start": 48.08, "end": 49.08, "text": "What happens if I don't?"}, {"start": 49.08, "end": 51.08, "text": "I miss the heart-opening deadline."}, {"start": 51.08, "end": 53.92, "text": "Valentine's crappin' time."}, {"start": 53.92, "end": 57.04, "text": "Opening my heart is on my list."}, {"start": 57.04, "end": 58.04, "text": "Piers?"}, {"start": 58.04, "end": 59.04, "text": "Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 59.04, "end": 60.04, "text": "What was that?"}, {"start": 60.04, "end": 61.04, "text": "Gum."}, {"start": 61.04, "end": 62.04, "text": "Why aren't you chewing?"}, {"start": 62.04, "end": 64.32, "text": "Because I'm using my mouth for this dumb conversation."}, {"start": 64.32, "end": 65.32, "text": "Bye."}, {"start": 65.32, "end": 69.21083333333333, "text": "That's my friend Paige,"}, {"start": 69.21083333333333, "end": 73.44, "text": "she's cool, but whatever."}, {"start": 73.44, "end": 74.44, "text": "She's cute."}, {"start": 74.44, "end": 77.04988235294117, "text": "Oh, Troy, before you go barking up that tree, I"}, {"start": 77.04988235294117, "end": 79.16, "text": "have to tell you that she might not be"}, {"start": 79.16, "end": 80.16, "text": "interested."}, {"start": 80.16, "end": 81.16, "text": "Why wouldn't she be..."}, {"start": 81.16, "end": 82.16, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 82.16, "end": 85.52, "text": "Is she a friend of Ellen?"}, {"start": 85.52, "end": 88.52, "text": "Yes, Annie, but you can say the word."}, {"start": 88.52, "end": 90.52, "text": "Paige is a lesbian."}, {"start": 90.52, "end": 95.52, "text": "Piers, as someone who's been calling me a lesbian for the last year and a half, I'm"}, {"start": 100.1683, "end": 104.1683, "text": "sure that you don't have anything to say about me being friends with one."}, {"start": 104.1683, "end": 105.1683, "text": "Nothing off the cuff."}, {"start": 105.1683, "end": 107.6683, "text": "What I do have is a prepared statement."}, {"start": 123.09200000000001, "end": 127.56500000000001, "text": "And in"}, {"start": 127.56500000000001, "end": 135.55250000000004, "text": "summation,"}, {"start": 135.55250000000004, "end": 138.74750000000003, "text": "good"}, {"start": 138.74750000000003, "end": 144.71150000000003, "text": "luck and"}, {"start": 144.71150000000003, "end": 146.94800000000004, "text": "bon"}, {"start": 146.94800000000004, "end": 152.91200000000003, "text": "appetit."}, {"start": 155.97800000000004, "end": 158.91800000000003, "text": "Many, many paragraphs of that were oddly supportive."}, {"start": 158.91800000000003, "end": 162.39800000000002, "text": "Wait till you hear the one I have for you."}, {"start": 162.39800000000002, "end": 166.35800000000003, "text": "Okay, I know that wasn't gum."}, {"start": 166.35800000000003, "end": 167.35800000000003, "text": "You're right."}, {"start": 167.35800000000003, "end": 169.27800000000002, "text": "It was an awesome exit pill."}, {"start": 169.27800000000002, "end": 172.07800000000003, "text": "Zip, zap, zooey!"}, {"start": 172.07800000000003, "end": 175.11800000000002, "text": "Bye."}, {"start": 183.41200000000003, "end": 185.45200000000006, "text": "We gotta do something about Piers and those painkillers."}, {"start": 185.45200000000006, "end": 186.97200000000004, "text": "He's recovering from broken legs."}, {"start": 186.97200000000004, "end": 188.13200000000003, "text": "He sure is."}, {"start": 188.13200000000003, "end": 189.13200000000003, "text": "You can moonwalk."}, {"start": 189.13200000000003, "end": 191.25200000000004, "text": "Now, I'm sure he's almost through his prescription."}, {"start": 191.25200000000004, "end": 192.53200000000004, "text": "Besides, he's a baby boomer."}, {"start": 192.53200000000004, "end": 193.53200000000004, "text": "They invented drugs."}, {"start": 193.53200000000004, "end": 195.57200000000003, "text": "Yeah, they also invented TV."}, {"start": 195.57200000000003, "end": 197.37200000000004, "text": "Have you seen him control one of those?"}, {"start": 197.37200000000004, "end": 199.41200000000003, "text": "Intervention, intervention, intervention."}, {"start": 199.41200000000003, "end": 200.41200000000003, "text": "Count me out."}, {"start": 200.41200000000003, "end": 201.41200000000003, "text": "We can't count you out."}, {"start": 201.41200000000003, "end": 202.41200000000003, "text": "He listens to you."}, {"start": 202.41200000000003, "end": 203.41200000000003, "text": "Well, he also listens to the Bare Naked Ladies."}, {"start": 203.41200000000003, "end": 205.09200000000004, "text": "Go get their dumbasses to help you."}, {"start": 205.09200000000004, "end": 206.09200000000004, "text": "Whoa!"}, {"start": 206.09200000000004, "end": 207.09200000000004, "text": "Back it up."}, {"start": 207.09200000000004, "end": 209.52305882352945, "text": "Okay, Jeff, you are clearly in a bad space"}, {"start": 209.52305882352945, "end": 212.01200000000006, "text": "today, but Piers is our friend and the Bare"}, {"start": 212.01200000000006, "end": 213.81200000000004, "text": "Naked Ladies are triple platinum."}, {"start": 213.81200000000004, "end": 214.81200000000004, "text": "Are you?"}, {"start": 214.81200000000004, "end": 218.41200000000003, "text": "Why does everyone leap to defend that band so aggressively?"}, {"start": 218.41200000000003, "end": 219.69670588235297, "text": "And how much stuff do we have to go"}, {"start": 219.69670588235297, "end": 221.53200000000004, "text": "through this year before my friendship stops being"}, {"start": 221.53200000000004, "end": 222.53200000000004, "text": "questioned?"}, {"start": 222.53200000000004, "end": 225.53200000000004, "text": "My friendship is about going through a lot of stuff, Jeff."}, {"start": 225.53200000000004, "end": 228.33200000000005, "text": "And maybe B&L has two billboard awards to your zero."}, {"start": 228.33200000000005, "end": 229.33200000000005, "text": "Oh, okay."}, {"start": 229.33200000000005, "end": 230.33200000000005, "text": "They're B&L now."}, {"start": 230.33200000000005, "end": 233.21200000000005, "text": "We need a shorthand for the Bare Naked Ladies."}, {"start": 233.21200000000005, "end": 234.85200000000003, "text": "That's how fundamental they are."}, {"start": 234.85200000000003, "end": 235.85200000000003, "text": "Fundamentals."}, {"start": 235.85200000000003, "end": 238.45200000000006, "text": "You know what Piers probably needs more than anything?"}, {"start": 238.45200000000006, "end": 239.45200000000006, "text": "Some space."}, {"start": 239.45200000000006, "end": 240.97200000000004, "text": "Maybe I do too."}, {"start": 240.97200000000004, "end": 241.97200000000004, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 241.97200000000004, "end": 243.57200000000003, "text": "Maybe we all need some space to pull the"}, {"start": 243.57200000000003, "end": 245.33200000000005, "text": "knife out of the back of the most celebrated"}, {"start": 245.33200000000005, "end": 249.49200000000005, "text": "Canadian alt-rock band of the mid-90s, you selfish, jaded ass."}, {"start": 249.49200000000005, "end": 251.57200000000003, "text": "This is a fight."}, {"start": 251.57200000000003, "end": 253.33200000000005, "text": "We are fighting."}, {"start": 253.33200000000005, "end": 254.33200000000005, "text": "Jeff."}, {"start": 254.33200000000005, "end": 255.33200000000005, "text": "Hello."}, {"start": 255.33200000000005, "end": 258.77200000000005, "text": "I hear you're fighting with your study group."}, {"start": 258.77200000000005, "end": 259.77200000000005, "text": "Correct."}, {"start": 259.77200000000005, "end": 261.7339047619048, "text": "Now, you won't know this being American,"}, {"start": 261.7339047619048, "end": 263.89200000000005, "text": "but tonight Liverpool are playing Manchester"}, {"start": 263.89200000000005, "end": 264.89200000000005, "text": "United."}, {"start": 264.89200000000005, "end": 266.97200000000004, "text": "I'm a stylish American professor."}, {"start": 266.97200000000004, "end": 269.53200000000004, "text": "I've been forcing myself to be into soccer since 2004."}, {"start": 269.53200000000004, "end": 271.13200000000006, "text": "Ah, Dennis Destiny."}, {"start": 271.13200000000006, "end": 274.41200000000003, "text": "God gave you a British friend and a massive TV for a reason."}, {"start": 274.41200000000003, "end": 276.5729302325582, "text": "Oh, it's Valentine's Day and even though we're"}, {"start": 276.5729302325582, "end": 278.452, "text": "fighting, I did promise the study group."}, {"start": 278.452, "end": 279.452, "text": "I go to the dance."}, {"start": 279.452, "end": 280.452, "text": "You promised his study group?"}, {"start": 280.452, "end": 281.452, "text": "Whip a crack."}, {"start": 281.452, "end": 285.2433924050633, "text": "I'll see you at precisely 630 or"}, {"start": 285.2433924050633, "end": 290.812, "text": "as the English call it, gravedigger's biscuits."}, {"start": 290.812, "end": 294.452, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 294.452, "end": 297.25200000000007, "text": "That moonwalk back there was streets ahead, buddy."}, {"start": 297.25200000000007, "end": 298.692, "text": "Hey, thanks buddy."}, {"start": 298.692, "end": 299.692, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 299.692, "end": 300.692, "text": "Hey, Piers."}, {"start": 300.692, "end": 301.692, "text": "Hey, it's you."}, {"start": 301.692, "end": 304.692, "text": "Yeah, the tiny man you see when you take enough pills."}, {"start": 304.692, "end": 307.51200000000006, "text": "We have a good time, don't we, Piers?"}, {"start": 307.51200000000006, "end": 308.51200000000006, "text": "I ain't hurting."}, {"start": 308.51200000000006, "end": 312.6120000000001, "text": "You want to keep this going, right, because I'm sure you've noticed the prescription"}, {"start": 312.6120000000001, "end": 313.692, "text": "is almost done."}, {"start": 313.692, "end": 317.77200000000005, "text": "Uh, but I don't think the doctor is doctor, and you know, I don't think he won't."}, {"start": 317.77200000000005, "end": 323.2320000000001, "text": "Piers, if doctors are so smart, why are there millions of them?"}, {"start": 323.2320000000001, "end": 327.77200000000005, "text": "Look in your hand."}, {"start": 327.77200000000005, "end": 330.572, "text": "It's Valentine's, buddy."}, {"start": 330.572, "end": 332.7320000000001, "text": "Be mine."}, {"start": 332.7320000000001, "end": 338.812, "text": "Mariah, my name is Abed Nadeer, my associate Troy Barnes."}, {"start": 338.812, "end": 339.812, "text": "Charmed, I'm sure."}, {"start": 339.812, "end": 343.0920000000001, "text": "Are you the guys that keep staring at me and intermittently yelling out books?"}, {"start": 343.0920000000001, "end": 344.0920000000001, "text": "The very same."}, {"start": 344.0920000000001, "end": 345.73424719101126, "text": "We're both interested in taking you to the"}, {"start": 345.73424719101126, "end": 347.572, "text": "Valentine's dance, but we are also best friends"}, {"start": 347.572, "end": 348.572, "text": "with each other."}, {"start": 348.572, "end": 351.0920000000001, "text": "It is of utmost importance we protect that friendship from the stresses of courting"}, {"start": 351.0920000000001, "end": 353.9720000000001, "text": "you, so we're trying to be as direct and above board about this as possible."}, {"start": 353.9720000000001, "end": 356.9720000000001, "text": "Will you go to the dance with one of us, and if so, which one?"}, {"start": 356.9720000000001, "end": 360.172, "text": "We need to get something straight first."}, {"start": 360.172, "end": 362.8520000000001, "text": "This is the cutest thing that's ever happened to me."}, {"start": 362.8520000000001, "end": 365.65200000000004, "text": "But, I don't know either one of you."}, {"start": 365.65200000000004, "end": 367.692, "text": "Give us a moment."}, {"start": 367.692, "end": 371.572, "text": "Do I need to eat those tacos?"}, {"start": 371.572, "end": 372.572, "text": "New proposal."}, {"start": 372.572, "end": 375.7320000000001, "text": "Get the notes at the dance and decide there which of us you'd like to see again."}, {"start": 375.7320000000001, "end": 377.572, "text": "Okay, deal."}, {"start": 377.572, "end": 378.572, "text": "Nice."}, {"start": 378.572, "end": 380.812, "text": "What's in the briefcase?"}, {"start": 380.812, "end": 383.572, "text": "Oh, tacos."}, {"start": 383.572, "end": 384.572, "text": "You want one?"}, {"start": 384.572, "end": 385.572, "text": "No."}, {"start": 385.572, "end": 386.572, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 386.572, "end": 387.572, "text": "We really wanted them."}, {"start": 387.572, "end": 389.572, "text": "Yeah, we're gonna eat them."}, {"start": 389.572, "end": 392.932, "text": "So, like, would you change clothes in front of her?"}, {"start": 392.932, "end": 394.61858823529417, "text": "Annie, I know your lack of world"}, {"start": 394.61858823529417, "end": 397.41200000000003, "text": "experience creates curiosity, but questions like that"}, {"start": 397.41200000000003, "end": 399.572, "text": "can make you seem a little bit homophobic."}, {"start": 399.572, "end": 401.13200000000006, "text": "It's homophobic to ask questions?"}, {"start": 401.13200000000006, "end": 402.724380952381, "text": "If you have to ask, if it's homophobic"}, {"start": 402.724380952381, "end": 404.65200000000004, "text": "to ask questions, haven't you already answered"}, {"start": 404.65200000000004, "end": 406.89200000000005, "text": "your own question?"}, {"start": 406.89200000000005, "end": 407.89200000000005, "text": "Have I?"}, {"start": 407.89200000000005, "end": 408.89200000000005, "text": "Don't know."}, {"start": 408.89200000000005, "end": 409.89200000000005, "text": "Not a homophobe."}, {"start": 409.89200000000005, "end": 413.572, "text": "Oh, there's Paige."}, {"start": 413.572, "end": 415.7929523809524, "text": "Should I ask her 500 questions about being a"}, {"start": 415.7929523809524, "end": 417.812, "text": "lesbian, or should I just treat her like"}, {"start": 417.812, "end": 419.29200000000003, "text": "a normal person?"}, {"start": 419.29200000000003, "end": 421.29200000000003, "text": "That's a question you can ask."}, {"start": 421.29200000000003, "end": 423.29200000000003, "text": "What's going on?"}, {"start": 423.29200000000003, "end": 424.29200000000003, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 424.29200000000003, "end": 425.29200000000003, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 425.29200000000003, "end": 426.29200000000003, "text": "I'm not a lesbian."}, {"start": 426.29200000000003, "end": 427.29200000000003, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 427.29200000000003, "end": 428.29200000000003, "text": "I'm not either."}, {"start": 428.29200000000003, "end": 429.29200000000003, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 429.29200000000003, "end": 430.29200000000003, "text": "But it's cool that your friend's with one."}, {"start": 430.29200000000003, "end": 431.29200000000003, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 431.29200000000003, "end": 432.29200000000003, "text": "Paige isn't a lesbian."}, {"start": 432.29200000000003, "end": 438.55944186046514, "text": "She just likes hanging out with Britta because it"}, {"start": 438.55944186046514, "end": 443.29200000000003, "text": "makes her feel cool to have a lesbian"}, {"start": 443.29200000000003, "end": 444.29200000000003, "text": "friend."}, {"start": 444.29200000000003, "end": 446.41200000000003, "text": "But Britta's not a lesbian."}, {"start": 446.41200000000003, "end": 450.13200000000006, "text": "She thinks that Paige is."}, {"start": 453.061, "end": 454.061, "text": "Guess what, Annie?"}, {"start": 454.061, "end": 457.161, "text": "Paige and I are going to the dance together."}, {"start": 457.161, "end": 459.661, "text": "Hope I stay straight."}, {"start": 459.661, "end": 460.661, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 460.661, "end": 461.661, "text": "Sorry."}, {"start": 461.661, "end": 467.7794, "text": "My friend's a tad homophobic, so"}, {"start": 467.7794, "end": 471.221, "text": "I was doing a bit."}, {"start": 471.221, "end": 472.301, "text": "Ooh."}, {"start": 472.301, "end": 473.901, "text": "Pretty exciting first half."}, {"start": 473.901, "end": 474.901, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 474.901, "end": 475.901, "text": "Zero zero electrifying."}, {"start": 475.901, "end": 476.901, "text": "Aw."}, {"start": 476.901, "end": 481.501, "text": "I'm worried that your six-headed ball and chain will be calling."}, {"start": 481.501, "end": 484.501, "text": "Fine."}, {"start": 484.501, "end": 490.501, "text": "That's better, you big slut."}, {"start": 494.027, "end": 495.027, "text": "It's Chang."}, {"start": 495.027, "end": 496.027, "text": "Chang?"}, {"start": 496.027, "end": 497.027, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 497.027, "end": 498.027, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 498.027, "end": 499.267, "text": "I can hear you guys."}, {"start": 499.267, "end": 500.387, "text": "What are you doing here, Chang?"}, {"start": 500.387, "end": 501.387, "text": "And how do you know where I live?"}, {"start": 501.387, "end": 505.227, "text": "I can answer both of those questions by returning your driver's license."}, {"start": 505.227, "end": 510.707, "text": "Ha!"}, {"start": 510.707, "end": 511.707, "text": "There it is."}, {"start": 511.707, "end": 512.707, "text": "Man, you versus Liverpool."}, {"start": 512.707, "end": 513.707, "text": "For God's sake."}, {"start": 513.707, "end": 514.707, "text": "Just let him in."}, {"start": 514.707, "end": 516.827, "text": "He's wearing the right colors and everything."}, {"start": 516.827, "end": 517.827, "text": "Come in."}, {"start": 517.827, "end": 519.6669999999999, "text": "Don't mind if it's Chang."}, {"start": 519.6669999999999, "end": 520.6669999999999, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 520.6669999999999, "end": 521.6669999999999, "text": "Hey, man."}, {"start": 521.6669999999999, "end": 524.6669999999999, "text": "Check this out."}, {"start": 524.6669999999999, "end": 526.267, "text": "Yah!"}, {"start": 526.267, "end": 532.1386417910448, "text": "Well, anyway, the thing I was going"}, {"start": 532.1386417910448, "end": 537.5070000000001, "text": "to show you guys is pretty cool."}, {"start": 537.5070000000001, "end": 539.527, "text": "I'm ignoring you and watching soccer."}, {"start": 539.527, "end": 541.107, "text": "Just sit down, Chang."}, {"start": 541.107, "end": 543.387, "text": "There's space for three fannies on this sofa."}, {"start": 543.387, "end": 545.867, "text": "Hey, in England, fanny means vagina, right?"}, {"start": 545.867, "end": 548.067, "text": "In England, everything means vagina."}, {"start": 548.067, "end": 554.267, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you, winger, even though, like I said, we're a place to put"}, {"start": 554.267, "end": 555.267, "text": "a lamp."}, {"start": 555.267, "end": 556.267, "text": "Let me order a pizza."}, {"start": 556.267, "end": 557.267, "text": "Ooh, I love pizza!"}, {"start": 557.267, "end": 558.267, "text": "In England, we call them Italian fannies."}, {"start": 558.267, "end": 559.267, "text": "I'm hooking us up."}, {"start": 559.267, "end": 560.267, "text": "Sally."}, {"start": 560.267, "end": 561.267, "text": "Nah, go use the land line."}, {"start": 561.267, "end": 562.267, "text": "Land line?"}, {"start": 562.267, "end": 563.267, "text": "Okay, Grandma Bill."}, {"start": 563.267, "end": 564.267, "text": "Starburns."}, {"start": 564.267, "end": 565.267, "text": "It's Chang."}, {"start": 565.267, "end": 566.267, "text": "Remember that pizzi, Omi?"}, {"start": 566.267, "end": 567.267, "text": "Well, it's time to pay up."}, {"start": 567.267, "end": 568.267, "text": "Party at Winger's tonight."}, {"start": 568.267, "end": 569.267, "text": "Yeah, you can tell people."}, {"start": 569.267, "end": 570.267, "text": "Wing Bing at Winger's."}, {"start": 570.267, "end": 574.3933157894737, "text": "So, Mariah,"}, {"start": 574.3933157894737, "end": 577.3942727272728, "text": "what you"}, {"start": 577.3942727272728, "end": 582.3833636363637, "text": "get with me is"}, {"start": 582.3833636363637, "end": 586.8735454545455, "text": "the complete"}, {"start": 586.8735454545455, "end": 589.867, "text": "package."}, {"start": 589.867, "end": 591.867, "text": "HBO, Showtime, Starz, Starz Black."}, {"start": 591.867, "end": 595.5047011494253, "text": "With all due respect to my friend here, if you"}, {"start": 595.5047011494253, "end": 598.7470000000001, "text": "go with me, you can expect this on a fast"}, {"start": 598.7470000000001, "end": 599.7470000000001, "text": "floor."}, {"start": 599.7470000000001, "end": 600.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 600.7470000000001, "end": 601.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 601.7470000000001, "end": 602.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 602.7470000000001, "end": 603.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 603.7470000000001, "end": 604.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 604.7470000000001, "end": 605.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 605.7470000000001, "end": 606.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 606.7470000000001, "end": 607.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 607.7470000000001, "end": 608.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 608.7470000000001, "end": 609.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 609.7470000000001, "end": 610.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 610.7470000000001, "end": 611.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 611.7470000000001, "end": 612.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 612.7470000000001, "end": 613.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 613.7470000000001, "end": 614.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 614.7470000000001, "end": 615.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 615.7470000000001, "end": 616.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 616.7470000000001, "end": 617.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 617.7470000000001, "end": 618.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 618.7470000000001, "end": 619.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 630.7470000000001, "end": 631.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 631.7470000000001, "end": 632.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 632.7470000000001, "end": 633.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 633.7470000000001, "end": 634.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 634.7470000000001, "end": 635.7470000000001, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 635.7470000000001, "end": 636.012, "text": "I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 636.012, "end": 638.972, "text": "♪ Baby do the talk, show me what you got ♪"}, {"start": 638.972, "end": 640.6519999999999, "text": "♪ In terms of fancy fun ♪"}, {"start": 640.6519999999999, "end": 641.9119999999999, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 641.9119999999999, "end": 643.112, "text": "♪ What's good, empty stuff ♪"}, {"start": 643.112, "end": 644.452, "text": "♪ What's good, empty stuff ♪"}, {"start": 644.452, "end": 645.452, "text": "♪ What's good, empty stuff ♪"}, {"start": 645.452, "end": 646.852, "text": "♪ What's good, empty stuff ♪"}, {"start": 646.852, "end": 649.1519999999999, "text": "♪ What's good, empty stuff ♪"}, {"start": 649.1519999999999, "end": 650.6519999999999, "text": "♪ What's good, empty stuff ♪"}, {"start": 650.6519999999999, "end": 653.5319999999999, "text": "- Oh, nice cool ref, bite my banger."}, {"start": 653.5319999999999, "end": 656.592, "text": "- Jeff, something's up with your toothbrush, man."}, {"start": 656.592, "end": 657.592, "text": "- What the hell?"}, {"start": 657.592, "end": 658.632, "text": "- I had to get cleaned up."}, {"start": 658.632, "end": 659.472, "text": "- Why?"}, {"start": 661.5719999999999, "end": 662.8519999999999, "text": "- Oh yeah!"}, {"start": 662.8519999999999, "end": 664.132, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 664.132, "end": 665.512, "text": "- Pizza time."}, {"start": 665.512, "end": 666.352, "text": "- Leonard?"}, {"start": 666.352, "end": 667.712, "text": "- Where are the white women at?"}, {"start": 667.712, "end": 669.5719999999999, "text": "- No, there are no white women here, Leonard."}, {"start": 669.5719999999999, "end": 670.952, "text": "This is not a party."}, {"start": 670.952, "end": 672.852, "text": "- Don't tell that to magnitude."}, {"start": 672.852, "end": 674.1519999999999, "text": "- Who's magnitude?"}, {"start": 674.1519999999999, "end": 676.852, "text": "- Yo, yo, yo, yo, yo, pop, pop."}, {"start": 676.852, "end": 678.592, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 678.592, "end": 679.8919999999999, "text": "- Boom!"}, {"start": 679.8919999999999, "end": 681.1919999999999, "text": "Boom!"}, {"start": 681.1919999999999, "end": 682.852, "text": "- Come on in, Jason."}, {"start": 682.852, "end": 685.7919999999999, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 685.7919999999999, "end": 689.1919999999999, "text": "- That is my analysis of the Saw movie franchise."}, {"start": 689.1919999999999, "end": 690.472, "text": "That about does it, Saw."}, {"start": 690.472, "end": 691.992, "text": "I think it's time for you to choose."}, {"start": 691.992, "end": 694.5719999999999, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 696.0319999999999, "end": 697.7719999999999, "text": "- Abed, could you get us some punch?"}, {"start": 697.7719999999999, "end": 698.612, "text": "- On him."}, {"start": 700.9119999999999, "end": 702.712, "text": "- You guys are really cute together."}, {"start": 702.712, "end": 704.1719999999999, "text": "- Ah, thank you."}, {"start": 704.1719999999999, "end": 708.0519999999999, "text": "- But, you know, having to actually choose, I--"}, {"start": 708.0519999999999, "end": 710.212, "text": "- Hey, we both agreed to this."}, {"start": 710.212, "end": 712.252, "text": "We're both very comfortable with each other, so I won't be--"}, {"start": 712.252, "end": 713.592, "text": "- No, I choose you, Troy."}, {"start": 715.852, "end": 716.692, "text": "- Punch."}, {"start": 717.852, "end": 718.692, "text": "- Hey, Abed."}, {"start": 718.692, "end": 719.6519999999999, "text": "- Hey."}, {"start": 719.6519999999999, "end": 723.092, "text": "- I, um, she just, she chose me."}, {"start": 724.8919999999999, "end": 727.2919999999999, "text": "- Cool, you can have this now."}, {"start": 727.2919999999999, "end": 728.132, "text": "Thank you, Mariah."}, {"start": 728.132, "end": 729.232, "text": "Have a great night."}, {"start": 729.232, "end": 731.8319999999999, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 734.872, "end": 737.4119999999999, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 737.4119999999999, "end": 738.6519999999999, "text": "- Ready?"}, {"start": 738.6519999999999, "end": 739.5719999999999, "text": "- Pierce?"}, {"start": 739.5719999999999, "end": 741.112, "text": "- You go straight to hell."}, {"start": 744.692, "end": 747.452, "text": "- Oh, I'm sorry, I, I don't know."}, {"start": 747.452, "end": 749.852, "text": "I've been going through all these mood swings lately."}, {"start": 749.852, "end": 752.0319999999999, "text": "- You understand we care about you, right?"}, {"start": 754.3319999999999, "end": 755.1719999999999, "text": "- Okay."}, {"start": 757.4319999999999, "end": 759.6719999999999, "text": "- Well, look, here's the deal."}, {"start": 759.6719999999999, "end": 762.8319999999999, "text": "I am not sharing you with them."}, {"start": 762.8319999999999, "end": 765.472, "text": "So before this goes further,"}, {"start": 765.472, "end": 767.4119999999999, "text": "you have a choice to make, my friend."}, {"start": 770.4119999999999, "end": 771.452, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 771.452, "end": 772.872, "text": "Look at the lesbians."}, {"start": 776.4119999999999, "end": 777.452, "text": "Lesbians!"}, {"start": 777.452, "end": 778.2919999999999, "text": "- Screw you!"}, {"start": 781.612, "end": 784.1519999999999, "text": "Oh, I, I, no, no."}, {"start": 784.1519999999999, "end": 785.3319999999999, "text": "- I don't care what they say."}, {"start": 785.3319999999999, "end": 786.452, "text": "- No, I don't either."}, {"start": 786.452, "end": 788.5319999999999, "text": "I just wish it wasn't such an issue for them."}, {"start": 788.5319999999999, "end": 790.132, "text": "- Yeah, but that starts with us."}, {"start": 791.732, "end": 793.7719999999999, "text": "That starts with us."}, {"start": 798.0319999999999, "end": 800.2719999999999, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 807.852, "end": 810.3119999999999, "text": "- I've never done this before, I don't mean either."}, {"start": 810.3119999999999, "end": 811.212, "text": "- Wait, what?"}, {"start": 814.492, "end": 818.3319999999999, "text": "- So, curious about one thing."}, {"start": 819.252, "end": 820.8919999999999, "text": "What was wrong with Abed?"}, {"start": 820.8919999999999, "end": 823.232, "text": "- Well, I mean, he did talk about the Saw movies"}, {"start": 823.232, "end": 824.2919999999999, "text": "for two hours."}, {"start": 824.2919999999999, "end": 826.2919999999999, "text": "- Yeah, but there are eight of them,"}, {"start": 826.2919999999999, "end": 827.8319999999999, "text": "and they're two hours a piece."}, {"start": 827.8319999999999, "end": 829.8319999999999, "text": "And the first one did redefine the genre, and--"}, {"start": 829.8319999999999, "end": 832.3319999999999, "text": "- Jen, I would love to be his friend."}, {"start": 832.3319999999999, "end": 833.732, "text": "- I know you would, it's incredible."}, {"start": 833.732, "end": 838.1719999999999, "text": "- But romantically, you, you were funny."}, {"start": 841.012, "end": 843.512, "text": "- I hate her, I hate her, I hate her, I hate her!"}, {"start": 844.952, "end": 845.9119999999999, "text": "- What happened?"}, {"start": 845.9119999999999, "end": 847.6519999999999, "text": "- She called you weird."}, {"start": 847.6519999999999, "end": 848.492, "text": "- I am weird."}, {"start": 848.492, "end": 851.452, "text": "- Not as weird as her, who the hell is Nicholas Nickleby?"}, {"start": 851.452, "end": 853.692, "text": "You wouldn't shut up about it."}, {"start": 853.692, "end": 854.5319999999999, "text": "- I know."}, {"start": 856.9319999999999, "end": 858.732, "text": "- There's someone out there for us."}, {"start": 860.5719999999999, "end": 862.5319999999999, "text": "- Happy Valentine's Day."}, {"start": 862.5319999999999, "end": 863.372, "text": "- It is now."}, {"start": 872.372, "end": 873.212, "text": "Ignore her."}, {"start": 874.452, "end": 877.612, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 877.612, "end": 879.4119999999999, "text": "- It's weird, but I've never heard of magnitude"}, {"start": 879.4119999999999, "end": 880.592, "text": "before tonight."}, {"start": 880.592, "end": 882.752, "text": "- He's a one man party."}, {"start": 882.752, "end": 884.592, "text": "- You're gonna like Lizzie with your steady grip."}, {"start": 884.592, "end": 886.2919999999999, "text": "- Well, he's not with them tonight."}, {"start": 886.2919999999999, "end": 887.6119999999999, "text": "- Oh, yes!"}, {"start": 887.6119999999999, "end": 888.9319999999999, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 888.9319999999999, "end": 890.4319999999999, "text": "- You were drinking, Duncan."}, {"start": 890.4319999999999, "end": 891.8319999999999, "text": "- False love on that one."}, {"start": 891.8319999999999, "end": 893.672, "text": "- Oh, yeah!"}, {"start": 893.672, "end": 895.172, "text": "- Pop pop!"}, {"start": 895.172, "end": 896.672, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 904.3119999999999, "end": 905.872, "text": "- I never said I was a lesbian."}, {"start": 905.872, "end": 907.872, "text": "Why didn't you just ask me?"}, {"start": 907.872, "end": 909.5519999999999, "text": "- What am I, a homophobe?"}, {"start": 909.5519999999999, "end": 911.452, "text": "I don't care about people's preferences."}, {"start": 911.452, "end": 914.3919999999999, "text": "- You so care, you are clearly just hanging out with me"}, {"start": 914.3919999999999, "end": 915.8119999999999, "text": "because you thought I was gay."}, {"start": 915.8119999999999, "end": 918.8319999999999, "text": "- So, what were you doing with me?"}, {"start": 918.8319999999999, "end": 920.2919999999999, "text": "- Hey, what does it matter, you know?"}, {"start": 920.2919999999999, "end": 922.2919999999999, "text": "We're both just humans trying to make our way"}, {"start": 922.2919999999999, "end": 924.1519999999999, "text": "through this crazy world."}, {"start": 924.1519999999999, "end": 925.3319999999999, "text": "- You're the worst."}, {"start": 925.3319999999999, "end": 926.172, "text": "- What?"}, {"start": 926.172, "end": 928.672, "text": "- And for the record, I never thought you were cool."}, {"start": 928.672, "end": 930.5319999999999, "text": "I only thought you were a lesbian."}, {"start": 932.372, "end": 935.712, "text": "♪ And you saw the man ♪"}, {"start": 939.212, "end": 940.172, "text": "- Paige is straight."}, {"start": 941.7719999999999, "end": 942.612, "text": "- Really?"}, {"start": 944.112, "end": 947.252, "text": "Well, when she was gay,"}, {"start": 947.252, "end": 950.5519999999999, "text": "I thought it was really cool of you to make out with her."}, {"start": 950.5519999999999, "end": 951.692, "text": "- Thanks, Annie."}, {"start": 953.932, "end": 955.132, "text": "- Come on, kiss her!"}, {"start": 957.3919999999999, "end": 958.232, "text": "- Annie."}, {"start": 960.5719999999999, "end": 964.0719999999999, "text": "- Oh, hey, yeah!"}, {"start": 964.0719999999999, "end": 966.112, "text": "- Oh, thanks man, just leave those."}, {"start": 966.112, "end": 967.432, "text": "I'll get 'em in the morning."}, {"start": 967.432, "end": 968.2719999999999, "text": "- It's okay."}, {"start": 970.512, "end": 972.0719999999999, "text": "- Are you wearing my underwear?"}, {"start": 972.0719999999999, "end": 975.0519999999999, "text": "- Oh, I just needed a pair while I did some laundry here."}, {"start": 975.0519999999999, "end": 976.5519999999999, "text": "- I don't have a washing machine."}, {"start": 978.9119999999999, "end": 980.512, "text": "- What the hell?"}, {"start": 980.512, "end": 982.252, "text": "- Okay, don't get mad, don't get mad."}, {"start": 984.0919999999999, "end": 986.3519999999999, "text": "I'm homeless, Jeff, okay?"}, {"start": 986.3519999999999, "end": 987.732, "text": "When my wife found out about Shirley and me,"}, {"start": 987.732, "end": 989.952, "text": "she kicked me out for good this time."}, {"start": 989.952, "end": 993.692, "text": "My whole life is in this dishwasher, man."}, {"start": 993.692, "end": 996.192, "text": "Well, some of this is also soaking in her bathtub."}, {"start": 997.972, "end": 1000.432, "text": "Oh, so wasted and sleepy."}, {"start": 1000.432, "end": 1002.232, "text": "You know what, I should probably just crash here"}, {"start": 1002.232, "end": 1003.972, "text": "and you know what, I can start looking"}, {"start": 1003.972, "end": 1005.3119999999999, "text": "for a place in the morning."}, {"start": 1008.112, "end": 1009.872, "text": "You orchestrated this entire party"}, {"start": 1009.872, "end": 1012.012, "text": "just so you could weasel your way into staying here."}, {"start": 1012.012, "end": 1013.252, "text": "We're not even going to notice."}, {"start": 1013.252, "end": 1014.692, "text": "- Hey, Jeff, don't kill the messenger,"}, {"start": 1014.692, "end": 1017.492, "text": "but you have four hermit crabs in your bathroom sink."}, {"start": 1018.452, "end": 1019.7919999999999, "text": "- You'll fall in love with them."}, {"start": 1019.7919999999999, "end": 1021.0319999999999, "text": "- I named one Jeff."}, {"start": 1021.0319999999999, "end": 1022.5319999999999, "text": "- How long did you actually think you were going to stay here?"}, {"start": 1022.5319999999999, "end": 1023.932, "text": "- Just a month."}, {"start": 1023.932, "end": 1025.8319999999999, "text": "- Three tops."}, {"start": 1025.8319999999999, "end": 1027.732, "text": "I mean, how long's her lease?"}, {"start": 1037.112, "end": 1038.612, "text": "- Way to go, idiot!"}, {"start": 1043.452, "end": 1046.3519999999999, "text": "- All right, everybody out, I'm not kidding."}, {"start": 1047.552, "end": 1052.0919999999999, "text": "Very interesting getting to know you all much, much better."}, {"start": 1052.0919999999999, "end": 1055.992, "text": "Starburns, Leonard, magnitude, pop-pop,"}, {"start": 1055.992, "end": 1060.992, "text": "swizzle, scandalous, C-dub, Tim, Mighty D, glisten."}, {"start": 1062.172, "end": 1064.972, "text": "Good night, everyone, faster, move it, thank you."}, {"start": 1064.972, "end": 1068.232, "text": "- Well, I hope you found tonight therapeutic"}, {"start": 1068.232, "end": 1070.972, "text": "because I would love to pretend that that was my plan."}, {"start": 1072.3719999999998, "end": 1073.212, "text": "- I actually started to have fun"}, {"start": 1073.212, "end": 1075.452, "text": "until that maniac tried to move in."}, {"start": 1075.452, "end": 1078.752, "text": "- What is it about me that makes broken people flock to me?"}, {"start": 1078.752, "end": 1080.052, "text": "Is it my height?"}, {"start": 1080.052, "end": 1082.752, "text": "Do huddled masses mistake me for the Statue of Liberty?"}, {"start": 1082.752, "end": 1085.3519999999999, "text": "- I don't know, but being as how you are halfway"}, {"start": 1085.3519999999999, "end": 1087.252, "text": "through your second year at Greendale,"}, {"start": 1087.252, "end": 1090.232, "text": "you might want to either stop resisting"}, {"start": 1090.232, "end": 1092.792, "text": "or admit that you're actually starting to enjoy it."}, {"start": 1092.792, "end": 1094.3319999999999, "text": "- Well, you assume I enjoy it"}, {"start": 1094.3319999999999, "end": 1096.472, "text": "because you'd think you'd enjoy it."}, {"start": 1096.472, "end": 1099.432, "text": "- It's true, I am very lonely."}, {"start": 1102.138, "end": 1104.638, "text": "- You want a nice little taste"}, {"start": 1104.638, "end": 1107.4779999999998, "text": "of what you're missing in a relationship with six nutcases?"}, {"start": 1107.4779999999998, "end": 1109.0179999999998, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 1109.0179999999998, "end": 1111.158, "text": "- Let's turn on my phone and listen to the 39 messages"}, {"start": 1111.158, "end": 1112.0579999999998, "text": "they left tonight."}, {"start": 1113.2579999999998, "end": 1115.2979999999998, "text": "- Hello, you have no new messages."}, {"start": 1117.398, "end": 1121.4379999999999, "text": "- Huh, that's, huh."}, {"start": 1122.7979999999998, "end": 1124.098, "text": "- Since you got it turned on,"}, {"start": 1124.098, "end": 1126.6979999999999, "text": "why don't you call me a cabin and pay for it?"}, {"start": 1126.6979999999999, "end": 1128.2979999999998, "text": "- Must be in some kind of trouble."}, {"start": 1129.2379999999998, "end": 1132.078, "text": "- Ah, what a relief that would be."}, {"start": 1134.378, "end": 1135.578, "text": "Tell you what, if you need me,"}, {"start": 1135.578, "end": 1137.8379999999997, "text": "I'm going to be waiting for my cab down here."}, {"start": 1139.5179999999998, "end": 1140.6779999999999, "text": "I'll have a special nap."}, {"start": 1141.878, "end": 1144.378, "text": "(light music)"}, {"start": 1152.2579999999998, "end": 1153.098, "text": "- Oh!"}, {"start": 1166.3979999999997, "end": 1169.138, "text": "- Thanks, bro, I'll be gone in the morning."}, {"start": 1169.138, "end": 1170.7779999999998, "text": "- Yeah, whatever."}, {"start": 1170.7779999999998, "end": 1172.8379999999997, "text": "- Okay, maybe I stay a while."}, {"start": 1176.3779999999997, "end": 1177.618, "text": "Thirsty."}, {"start": 1177.618, "end": 1178.918, "text": "- Don't push it."}, {"start": 1178.918, "end": 1179.7579999999998, "text": "- All right."}, {"start": 1180.7579999999998, "end": 1182.2179999999998, "text": "- It might not shock you guys"}, {"start": 1182.2179999999998, "end": 1184.5179999999998, "text": "to hear the real reason we had a fight today."}, {"start": 1185.9579999999999, "end": 1187.7979999999998, "text": "It wasn't about the bare naked ladies,"}, {"start": 1187.7979999999998, "end": 1190.158, "text": "although I do have some unresolved issues there."}, {"start": 1190.9979999999998, "end": 1193.638, "text": "Caring about a person can be scary."}, {"start": 1193.638, "end": 1195.4979999999998, "text": "Caring about a person can be scary."}, {"start": 1195.4979999999998, "end": 1197.6779999999999, "text": "Caring about six people can be a horrifying,"}, {"start": 1197.6779999999999, "end": 1199.9379999999999, "text": "embarrassing nightmare, at least for me."}, {"start": 1200.9379999999999, "end": 1203.6779999999999, "text": "But if I can't say it today, when can I say it?"}, {"start": 1204.8379999999997, "end": 1205.8379999999997, "text": "I love you guys."}, {"start": 1207.0179999999998, "end": 1210.0179999999998, "text": "Oh, and Pierce, take it from an expert."}, {"start": 1210.0179999999998, "end": 1213.078, "text": "These knuckleheads are right outside your heart."}, {"start": 1213.078, "end": 1215.8579999999997, "text": "Let them in before it's too late."}, {"start": 1218.118, "end": 1219.2179999999998, "text": "Happy Valentine's Day."}, {"start": 1227.62, "end": 1228.4399999999998, "text": "- Be mine?"}, {"start": 1228.4399999999998, "end": 1229.7799999999997, "text": "- Right, yes."}, {"start": 1229.7799999999997, "end": 1230.62, "text": "- Love you."}, {"start": 1235.196, "end": 1236.036, "text": "- Amazing."}, {"start": 1241.2559999999999, "end": 1242.096, "text": "- You're cute?"}, {"start": 1243.296, "end": 1244.136, "text": "- No, wait."}, {"start": 1246.376, "end": 1247.196, "text": "Kiss me."}, {"start": 1247.196, "end": 1250.336, "text": "- There has got to be a way to make money off of this."}, {"start": 1251.376, "end": 1252.2759999999998, "text": "- I've been cheating."}, {"start": 1255.2179999999998, "end": 1257.478, "text": "- No, it says email me."}]}